&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Backend Engineer to join the payments platform team. You will design services that move money at scale &amp;amp; keep them observable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with Go or Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PostgreSQL and event-driven architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
